@startuml context
title Radar V1 system context
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

legend right
Green: bounded implementation evidence.
Yellow: confirmed responsibility/requirement; full path incomplete.
Red: method, ordering, or execution remains open.
endlegend

actor "Julio\narchitecture decision owner" as H
component "Radar configuration +\ntarget scenario" as CFG #FFF2CC
component "Planned MATLAB stimulus\ngenerator" as GEN #FFF2CC
component "Radar DUT\nADC samples → detection list" as DUT #FFF2CC
component "WP4/G2 evidence\nDDC streaming, selected dimensions,\nschedule, fusion, clustering" as EV #B7E1CD
component "Test-only truth-assisted\ncomparison / oracle" as ORACLE #FFF2CC
component "Full detection behavior,\nhardware, real-time performance" as OPEN #F4CCCC

H --> CFG : approves system decisions
CFG --> GEN : reproducible inputs
GEN --> DUT : planned direct ADC vectors
DUT --> EV : bounded verification
DUT ..> OPEN : not established by current evidence


note bottom of ORACLE
Truth-assisted migration comparison is test/oracle-only;
scenario truth never enters the production DUT.
end note
note bottom of DUT
Approved boundary: ADC samples through detection list.
Stimulus generation, test fixtures, and verification
remain outside the production detection path.
end note
@enduml
